<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">WAEBLANIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE HA WAEBLANIA</para>
  <para style="toc2">WAEBLANIA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ebl.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAEBLANIA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili lwa Waeblania lulo lupwilili lwa kuwabweza wanhu mioyo lulagusa vija Yesu viyauvikize uhokozi bwando wa Lagano da Umwaka. Lupwilili lwa Waeblania lwandikigwa kamba masala. Mulupwilili lwa Waeblania muna ng'humbukila 60 na kugendelela kulawa Mdilagano da Umwaka zilagusa goya vija Yesu viyauvikize uhokozi na sang'hano za Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko wa Kiyahudi. Sama ya kilamso kino, lupwilili luno lulondigwa luwagangamize Wayahudi wamtogole Kilisto. Lupwilili lwa Waeblania lolagusa vija Yesu viyagavikize Malagizo ga Musa giladi wakulu wa nhambiko sambiwalave nhosa kabili. Yesu katendeka nhosa sama ya vilozo vose, m'vipigiti vose. Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa mazua gano vivija wodaha kugangamizwa na lupwilili lwa Waeblania kugendelela kumkweleleza Yesu Kilisto, ayo yotutenda tweye tumtogole, na vivija tugendelela kwika nhamanila yetu kumwake (12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Haduhu munhu yovitanga yalihi yandike lupwilili lwa Waeblania, ila wasomi wagelegeza kamba lupwilili luno lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo, Luka, ama Banaba. Vivija hakitangigwa kipigiti lupwilili luno vilwandikigwe, ila wanhu wayagwe wotogola kamba lwandikigwa hachugu cha milao ya 70 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto. Wambo da Yelusalemu dibanangigwa mmilao ya 70 songela kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisto, ila yandike lupwilili luno kodilongelela wambo da Yelusalemu kamba dikala ding'hali hadinabanangigwa. Lupwilili lwa Waeblania lwandikigwa mdiwambo da Loma (13:24) na vodahika kamba luzunguluswa mwa wanhu bwando wamtogole Kilisto.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yandike lupwilili luno kolagusa kamba Yesu iyo mkulu ng'hani kubanza wahokozi wa Mulungu na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga (<char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 1:1-4:13">1:1—4:13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kogendelela kulagusa kamba Yesu iyo mkulu ng'hani kubanza wakulu wa nhambiko awo wosang'hanika muna Ing'anda ya mulungu mdiwambo da Yelusalemu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 4:14-7:28">4:14—7:28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Vivija sang'hano ya Yesu ng'hulu ng'hani kubanza Lagano da Umwaka Mulungu diyaditendile na wanhu zake kubitila Malagizo gayamgwelele Musa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 8:1-10:31">8:1—10:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Viyeshile kusimulila kamba Yesu iyo mkulu ng'hani kubanza vinhu vose, yandike lupwilili luno kolava ndagizi bwando za kusang'hana (<char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 10:32-13:17">10:32—13:17</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Hakimambukizo, komambukiza lupwilili luno na mbuli za kugangamiza wanhu na ndamsa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="HEB 13:18-25">13:18-25</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli ya Mulungu Kubitila Mwanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Umwaka Mulungu kalonga na wahenga zetu mianza bwando na mnzila bwando kubitila wahokozi, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>ila muna gamazua gano ga kimambukizo kalonga na tweye kubitila Mwanage ayo ulumwengu ulumbigwe kubitila heyo, na yasaguligwe kuvihala vinhu vose. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Heyo iyo unang'hazi wa yenzi ya Mulungu na kalinga kabisa na vija viyali, yovitenda vinhu vose vigendelele kukala kubitila mbuli zake zili na mhiko. Viyamambukize kuvisegeza vilozo, kakala hanhu ha hishima kumkono wa ukulume wa Mulungu Mkulu.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukulu wa Mwana wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>Mwana wa Mulungu kawa mkulu ng'hani kubanza wasenga wose wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, kamba vidili twaga Mulungu diyamgwelele vidili kulu ng'hani kubanza matwaga gao. <verse eid="HEB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>Kwavija Mulungu hamulongele msenga wake yoyose wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Gweye iyo Mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">lelo nigaluka Tataako.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">ZABULI 2:7</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Ama Mulungu hamulongele msenga wake yoyose wa kuulanga kamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:5">“Nie nowa Tataake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">na heyo kowa Mwanangu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2SAMWELI 7:14</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 17:13">1VIPIGITI 17:13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>Ila viyamgalile chaudele wake muulumwengu, kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:6">“Wasenga zangu wose wa kuulanga wamtambikile heyo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 32:43</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>Ila mmbuli ya wasenga zake wa kuulanga, Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:7">“Mulungu kowatuma wasenga zake wa kuulanga kamba beho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">na kamba moto ukwaka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">ZABULI 104:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>Ila mmbuli ya Mwana, Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">“Undewa wako, gweye Mulungu, wokala milongo yose!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">Kowatawala wanhu zako bila uzenzeleganye.<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>Gweye konogelwa na ganogile na kugehila gehile.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">Avo Mulungu, Mulungu wako, kakusagula gweye uwe uchana ya wayago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">mkukubaka mavuta gogala ndeng'ha.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">ZABULI 45:6-7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Na vivija kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:10">“Haichanduso, gweye Mndewa, kuilumba isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:10">na kuulumba ulanga na makono gako mwenyego.<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Vino vobanangika, ila gweye kosigala.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">Volala kamba vivalo.<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>Kovikunza kamba koti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">na vogaluka kamba vivalo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Ila gweye kowa vivo mazua gose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">na ugima wako wowa bule nziga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">ZABULI 102:25-27</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>Mulungu hamulongele msenga wake yoyose wa kuulanga mbuli zino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:13">“Kala kumkono wangu wa ukulume</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">mbaka vondaniweke wadumuka zako wawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">kamba kigoda cha kwikila magulu gako.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">ZABULI 110:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Avo wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga iwo walihi? Hewo iwo loho womsang'hanikila Mulungu na watumigwa na heyo kuwataza awo wondawabokele ukombola.<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ukombola Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Avo tolondigwa tugagoge ng'hani gaja gatuhulike giladi sambituhembeluswe kulawa muikweli ino. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Usenga upetigwe na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga ha wahenga zetu woneka kuwa kweli, na wose walekile kuukola ama waja waudulukile wabokela nhaguso iwalumbile. <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Todahaze kuhonyokwa kamba tuhauzabuza ukombola mkulu kamba uno? Ukombola awo Mndewa yakalile waichanduso kuupeta, usindilwa kumwetu tweye na awo wamuhulike. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Vivija Mulungu kalava usindila mmbuli ino mkutenda mizonza bwando, vilaguso, na mbuli za mkanganyo, na mkugola nhunza ya Loho wa Mulungu kamba viyalondile heyo.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yondayatukombole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Mulungu hawekile wasenga zake wa kuulanga wawe watawala wa ulumwengu ukwiza, ulumwengu utuupeta. <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Ila hana hanhu Mzinyandiko Zing'alile munhu imwe kamulongela Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:6">“Munhu iyo kinhu chaki hata umgese kamba vino?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Mwana wa munhu ayo yuumuhembekeza?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Mkipigiti kidodo kumtenda yawe hasi ya wasenga zako wa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">kum'vaza mkungo wa yenzi na hishima,<verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>na kwika vinhu vose hasi ya magulu gake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">ZABULI 8:4-6</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Mkuvika vinhu vose hasi yake, Mulungu halekile kinhu chochose sambikiwe hasi yake. Hata avo mkipigiti kino hatuvona vinhu vose kuwa hasi yake. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Ila tomona Yesu, ayo mkipigiti kidodo yekigwe hasi ya wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, sambi kavazigwa mkungo wa yenzi na hishima sama ya mgayo wa ifa, giladi sama ya ngekewa ya Mulungu kolondigwa yalanze ifa sama ya wanhu wose. <verse eid="HEB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Ilumba Mulungu, ayo sama ya heyo na kubitila heyo vinhu vose vilumbigwa, yamtende Yesu sambiyahungule hanhu mnzila ya migayo, giladi yawagale wanage bwando kuna iyenzi yake. Kwavija Yesu iyo mwanduso wa ukombola wao.<verse eid="HEB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Kwavija ayo yowang'aliza na awo wong'alizwa wose wana Tata imwe. Sama ya mbuli ino Yesu hona kinyala kuwakema hewo ndugu, <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>kamulongela Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:12">“Nodipeta twaga jako ha ndugu zangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">hagatigati ya wanhu wakutogole nokutogola gweye na nyila.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">ZABULI 22:22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>Na vivija, “Nokwika nhamanila yangu kumwake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:17">ISAYA 8:17</ref></char>.</note> Na vivija kalonga, “Na hano hamoja na iwana wayanigwelele Mulungu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:18">ISAYA 8:18</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Avo, kwavija wana wa Mulungu wana mulopa na nyama, na Yesu vivija kagaluka na kuwa na mulopa na nyama, avo kubitila ifa yamuhume ayo yali na mhiko za ifa, ayo yokemigwa Mwenembago. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>Na Yesu kawafungula waja ugima wao wose wikigwe muunyakadala sama ya bwembwe da ifa. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Kwavija itangika kamba hezile kuwataza wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, ila kulutaza lukolo lwa Ablaham. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Avo, vinoga ng'hani heyo kugaluka kamba ndugu zake mmbuli zose, giladi yawe Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko yali na bazi na nhamanila msang'hano ya Mulungu, na yailave mwenyego kuwa nhosa ya kuwasegezela wanhu vilozo vao. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Kwavija heyo mwenyego kagaya kipigiti viyakalile yogezigwa, avo kodaha kuwataza awo wali mkugezigwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Mkulu Kubanza Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, mumtogole Kilisto na mkemigwe na Mulungu, mgelegezeni Yesu, ayo Mulungu yamtumile kuwa Mkulu wa Wakulu Wose wa Nhambiko wa nhamanila ituilonga mwa wanhu. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Kakala na nhamanila ha Mulungu yamsagule heyo, kamba Musa viyakalile na nhamanila msang'hano yake Mng'anda ya Mulungu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ng'anda ya Mulungu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hano nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wa Mulungu.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Munhu yozenga ng'anda kobokela hishima bwando kubanza ng'anda yenyego. Vivija na Yesu kalumba kugweleligwa hishima ng'hulu kubanza Musa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Kwavija kila ng'anda izengigwa na munhu, ila Mulungu iyo mzenzi wa vinhu vose. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Musa kakala mtumigwa yalibule uzenzeleganye Mng'anda ya Mulungu giladi yazilonge mbuli zondazilongwe na Mulungu mazua ga hamwande. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Ila Kilisto iyo Mwana yalibule uzenzeleganye Mng'anda ya Mulungu. Na tweye twa ng'anda yake kamba tuhananahila ugangamalo wetu na tamanilo dituitopela.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuhumula kwa Wanhu wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>Avo, kamba viyolonga Loho wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:7">“Muhahulika dizwi da Mulungu lelo,<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>sambimuitende mioyo yenu kuwa midala kamba wahenga zenu viwakalile, avija viwamdulukile heyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">kipigiti kija viwakalile muluwala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:8">avija viwamgezile heyo.<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Ako wahenga zenu kuwanigazile na kunigeza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:9">hata kamba wakala wazonile sang'hano zangu mmilao malongo mane.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>Kino kicho kilamso niwonela lusango mulelo uja, na nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Mazua gose hawanitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">hawazigoga ndagizi zangu.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Avo nigevuzika na kuiduila, nilonga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Hawengila muisi ya mhumulo!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">ZABULI 95:7-11</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, teganyeni, sambikuwe na munhu mmwanza wenu yondayawe na moyo wihile na uleka kumtogola Mulungu, awo wondaumtende yamuleke Mulungu yali na ugima. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Muigangamize wenyego kwa wenyego mazua gose, kipigiti ing'hali lelo, giladi sambikuwe na munhu mmwanza wenu yondayavwiziligwe na vilozo na kugeligwa udala giladi yamdulukile Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Kwavija kamba tuhananahila mbaka hakimambukizo kamba vitukalile haichanduso, tweye towa wanhu tuli hamoja na Kilisto.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 3:15">“Kamba uhahulika dizwi da Mulungu lelo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">sambiutende moyo wako kuwa mdala, kamba viwakalile wahenga zenu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">viwamdulukile Mulungu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">ZABULI 95:7-8</ref></char>. </note><verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Wanhu walihi wahulike dizwi da Mulungu na kumdulukila? Si waja wose wasegezwe muisi ya Misili hasi ya ulongozi wa Musa? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Walihi Mulungu yakalile na lusango nawo mmilao malongo mane? Si waja watendile vilozo, awo wadanganhikile muluwala? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Wanhu walihi Mulungu iyawaduilile kamba hawengila muisi ya mhumulo ako kondayawatende wahumule, kamba si awo wamdulukile?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">MHETA 14:1-35</ref></char>. </note> <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Avo tona kamba hawadahile kwingila muisi ya mhumulo kwavija hawatogole.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Avo kwavija kilagano cha kwingila hanhu hake ha kuhumulila king'hali, tuteganye kamba munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu sambiyahumwe kwingila hanhu haja. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Kwavija tuuhulika Usenga Unogile kamba viwauhulike hewo. Wauhulika, ila hauwagwelele nzamo, kwavija viwauhulike hawautogole mnhamanila. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/>Avo tweye tutogole tokwingila hanhu haja ha kuhumulila, kamba Mulungu viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:3">“Mulusango lwangu niiduila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Hawengila hanhu hangu ha kuhumulila!’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">ZABULI 95:11</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Mulungu kalonga mbuli ino hata kamba sang'hano yake ikala imalile songela kipigiti chayaulumbile ulumwengu. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Kwavija hanhu hamoja muna Izinyandiko Zing'alile zodilonga zua da saba kamba vino, “Mulungu kahumula kutenda sang'hano zake zose mdizua da saba.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">MWANDUSO 2:2</ref></char>. </note> <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Na tena hana hanhu aho hachana Mulungu kolonga, “Hawengila hanhu hangu ha kuhumulila!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">ZABULI 95:11</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Kwavija awo umwaka wauhulike Usenga Unogile wahumwa kwingila sama ya udulu wao, ila hanhu ha Mulungu ha kuhumulila hekigwa sama ya wanhu kwingila. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Milao bwando hamwande Mulungu keka zua diyagwe na kadikema, “Lelo” ahaja viyalongile kubitila Daudi, kamba viilongigwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 4:7">“Kamba lelo muhahulika dizwi da Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">sambimtende mioyo yenu kuwa midala.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">ZABULI 95:7-8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Kwavija kamba Yoshua yahawagwelele wanhu mhumulo, Mulungu sambiyalonge kamba zua diyagwe da mhumulo ding'hali hadinakwiza. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Avo kuna kuhumula kuyagwe kwikigwe sama ya wanhu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yokwingila mmhumulo iyatulongele Mulungu vivija kolondigwa yahumule kutenda sang'hano zake, kamba Mulungu viyahumule kutenda sang'hano zake. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Avo natutende kila kitudaha twingile mmhumulo ija, giladi sambiyoneke munhu yoyose yondayahumwe mkuwinza udulu wa Waislaeli.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Kwavija mbuli ya Mulungu ina ugima tena ina mhiko. Ina ukali kubanza zele jojose dikanha kuno na kuno, yohoma na kuvigola moyo na loho, na kuvigola vipindi na uloto. Ina udaho wa kutagusa ngelegeza na sulukila za moyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Two-edged sword" file="Two-edgedSword_Heb4.12_GT00140.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="4:12">Zele Dikanha Kuno na Kuno</figure> <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Haduhu kinhu chondakifisigwe haulongozi wa Mulungu, ila vinhu vose vogubuligwa na kwikigwa hauhalangwe haulongozi wa meso gake. Na tweye tose tolondigwa tulave mheta zetu ha heyo.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mkulu wa Wakulu Wose wa Nhambiko Kubanza Wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Avo, avija vituli na Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kubanza wose yengile kuulanga, Yesu Mwana wa Mulungu, natuinanahile ng'hani nhamanila ituilonga. <figure style="fig" alt="High Priest" file="HighPriest_Heb2.17_GT00139.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="4:14">Mkulu wa Nhambiko</figure> <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>Kwavija Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko itulinayo kautanga udonhi utulinao, kwavija heyo kabitila migayo yose itugaya tweye bila kutenda vilozo. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Avo natukikwenhukile kigoda cha undewa cha Mulungu wetu yali na ngekewa bila kudumba, giladi tubokele bazi na tupate ngekewa ya kututaza mkipigiti tuhailonda.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Kila Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kasaguligwa kulawa mwa wanhu, na Mulungu kamsagula yatende sang'hano zake sama yao, kulava nhunza na nhosa za kukoma wang'onyo giladi vilozo vigeligwe kumgongo. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Kwavija heyo mwenyego kalegela mmbuli bwando, avo kodaha kuhola ha awo iwabozi na awo wotenda vilozo. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Na kwavija heyo mwenyego kalegela mmbuli bwando avo kolondigwa yalave nhosa ya kukoma wang'onyo sama ya vilozo vake mwenyego vivija na sama ya wanhu wayagwe. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/>Haduhu munhu yosagula mwenyego hishima ino ya kuwa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko. Ila munhu kotendigwa kuwa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko sama ya lukemo lwa Mulungu, kamba viyakalile Haloni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Vivija Kilisto hasagule mwenyego hishima ya kuwa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko. Ila Mulungu kamulongela,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:5">“Gweye iyo Mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">lelo nigaluka Tataako.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">ZABULI 2:7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>Vivija kalonga hanhu hayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 5:6">“Kowa mkulu wa nhambiko wa gunge na gunge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">kamba Melikizedeki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">ZABULI 110:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Yesu viyakalile muulumwengu uno, kakala yotambika na kupula mkumulilila Mulungu na dizwi kulu na mahozi ayo yodaha kumkombola kulawa mkudanganhika. Mulungu kamuhulika kwavija Yesu kakala yomuhishimila Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Hata kamba kakala Mwana wa Mulungu, kaifundiza wende kubitila gaja gamgazile. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>Viyagahumile gose, kawa mwanduso wa ukombola wa digunge ha awo womtogola. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Mulungu kamtenda heyo yawe Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kamba Melikizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzuma mwa awo Woileka Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Tuna vinhu bwando va kulonga mmbuli ino, ila vidala kuwapetela goya, kwavija mweye mwa wadala kuhulika. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Kipigiti kino mweye molondigwa mfundize wanhu wayagwe, ila mng'hali mulonda munhu yawafundize mafundo ga ichanduso ga usenga wa Mulungu. Molondigwa mung'we matombo na sio mandia gazamile. <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/>Munhu yoyose yokong'ha yang'hali mdodo, hamanya ganogile ama gehile. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Mandia gazamile gosasaligwa sama ya wanhu wakangale, awo kubitila mafundo wapata utango wa kusambula gehile na ganogile.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Avo natuchole kuulongozi kuna gamafundo gakangale na tugaleke kuchugu mafundo ga ichanduso ga Kilisto. Sambitwike kabili msingi wa mafundo ga kuleka mbuli zihile, na kumtogola Mulungu, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>mafundo ga ubatizo, kwikila makono, kuzuka kwa wanhu wadanganhike, na nhaguso ya digunge. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Na togatenda gano kamba Mulungu yahatutogoza.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Kwavija awo wakalile mmulangaza wa Mulungu na kuzilanza nhunza za kuulanga na kum'bokela Loho wa Mulungu, <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>na kuulanza unozi wa Usenga wa Mulungu na kuzilanza mhiko za ulumwengu ukwiza, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>abaho, waileka nhamanila, havidahika kuwabweza giladi waleke vilozo vao, kwavija hewo wenyego womuwamba kabili Mwana wa Mulungu mumsalaba na kumgela kinyala hauhalangwe.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Isi ija ing'wa mazi ga mvula iitoela mazua gose, na ija ilava mandia ha awo wailimile, yobokela motelo za Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/>Ila isi ija yoteza miba na mbigili haipetigwa, na ya mdihonzolomo da kudukumizwa. Hakimambukizo, yosomigwa.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Mbwiga zangu, hata kamba tuhalonga kamba vino, si kamba totogola kamba kuna mbuli zihile zitendeka mmwenu, ila totogola kamba motenda mbuli zinogile zilawa muukombola. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Mulungu kabule uzenzeleganye, na hadaha kuisemwa sang'hano yenu na noge dimmulagusile vija vumuwatazile wanhu zake na vija vumgendelela kuwataza. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>Na tweye tolonda wose mmwanza wenu mgendelele kuwanogela wanhu wayagwe mbaka Mulungu vondayawakeme, giladi vinhu vumtamanila mngelegeza vilawilile. <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>Hatulonda mweye muwe wakoka, ila tolonda muwege awo kubitila nhamanila na mwazaganyo wogahala ago gawailagane na Mulungu.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilagano cha Mulungu Kili na Ikweli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Mulungu viyekile kilagano na Ablaham, kaiduila mkuitambula heyo mwenyego, kwavija kukala haduhu yali mkulu kum'banza heyo giladi heyo yaiduilile kumwake, <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>kalonga, “Kweli, nokumoteza gweye na kukugwelela lukolo lukulu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:17">MWANDUSO 22:17</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Ablaham kazaganya, avo kabokela kija Mulungu kiyailagane nayo. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Wanhu woiduilila ija yali mkulu kuwabanza hewo, na kiduilo kija chosindila kija kilongigwe na kumambukiza mbamila zose. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Vivija Mulungu viyalondile kuwalagusila wahazi gaja gawailagane na heyo, kawalagusila kamba heyo si wa kugalukagaluka, kasindila mkuiduila. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Avo Mulungu kalava vinhu vibili, tanhu kilagano chake abaho kiduilo chake. Vinhu vino vibili havigalukaga, kwavija havidahika Mulungu yavwize. Avo tweye tukimbilile kumwake togeligwa mhiko ng'hani kudigoga tamanilo dili haulongozi wetu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/>Tuna tamanilo dino dili kamba nanga ya ugima wetu dili na mhiko na kutamanilwa. Ikwingila mgati ya Hanhu Hang'alile ha Mulungu kubitila guo ditungikigwe. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Avo Yesu katulongola kwingila haja sama yetu. Heyo katendigwa kuwa Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko wa gunge na gunge, kamba Melikizedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Mkulu wa Nhambiko Melikizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Melikizedeki kakala mndewa wa Salemu na mkulu wa nhambiko wa Mulungu Mkulu Ng'hani. Melikizedeki kaiting'hana na Ablaham kipigiti Ablaham viyakalile yobwela kulawa kuwahuma wandewa wane na kummoteza. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Na Ablaham kamgwelela Melikizedeki zaka ya kila kinhu kiyapatile. Nhegulo ya mwanduso wa twaga da Melikizedeki ikala “Mndewa Yalibule Uzenzeleganye,” na abaho mndewa wa Salemu, nhegulo yake iyo “Mndewa wa Tindiwalo.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Haduhu munhu yolutambula lukolo lwa Melikizedeki ama tataake ama mamaake, haduhu munhu yoitambula mvumbuka yake ama ifa yake. Heyo kalinga na Mwana wa Mulungu, na kogendelela kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko milongo yose.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Loleni viyali mkulu, hata muhenga wetu Ablaham kamgwelela zaka ya vinhu viyapatile kulawa kung'hondo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/>Na awo wali wa lukolo lwa Lawi wali wakulu wa nhambiko woshulutizwa na Malagizo ga Musa kusola zaka kulawa mwa wanhu wa Islaeli, kulawa mwa wanhu zao wenyego, hata kamba na hewo wolawa lukolo lwa Ablaham. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Melikizedeki hakalile munhu wa lukolo lwa Lawi, ila kasola zaka kulawa ha Ablaham na kummoteza Ablaham, ayo yabokele vilagano kulawa ha Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Haduhu bamila, ija yomoteza kolondigwa yawe mkulu kubanza ija yomotezwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Mmbuli ya wakulu wa nhambiko zaka yosoligwa na wanhu wali na ng'huli za kudanganhika, ila mmbuli ya Melikizedeki zaka ikala isoligwa na ayo yali na ugima wa digunge kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9"/>Munhu kodaha kulonga kamba Lawi mwenyego, ayo yobokela zaka, kaliha zaka ha Melikizedeki kubitila Ablaham, <verse eid="HEB 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10"/>kwavija Melikizedeki viyaiting'hane na Ablaham, Lawi kakala mgati ya lukuli lwa Ablaham Tataake, nhegulo yake kakala hanavumbuka.<verse eid="HEB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Kamba mnhongo wa ukulu wa nhambiko wa Lawi wabule king'hwaso kwavija Malagizo ga Musa gawavikila wanhu kubitila mnhongo uno, habali kukala kung'hali kulondigwa mkulu wa nhambiko iyagwe yeze kulawa mumnhongo wa ukulu wa nhambiko wa Melikizedeki na sio kulawa mumnhongo wa ukulu wa nhambiko wa Haloni? <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>Kwavija kamba kuhawa na mgaluko mumnhongo wa ukulu wa nhambiko, basi vivija kolondigwa kuwe na mgaluko Mmalagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Na mkulu wetu wa nhambiko, ayo mbuli zino zimulonga, kolawa mumtala uyagwe, na haduhu munhu hata imwe kulawa mumtala wake yasang'hanike sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>Itangika kamba Mndewa wetu kalawa mumtala wa Yuda, na Musa hamtambule munhu yoyose kulawa mumtala uno yawe mkulu wa nhambiko.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mkulu wa Nhambiko Iyagwe Yalingile na Melikizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Na gaja gatulongile gabule kifiso, kamba mkulu wa nhambiko iyagwe yalingile na Melikizedeki kalawilila, <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>ayo yatendigwe kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko si sama ya ndagizi ilawa Mmalagizo ga Musa ilonga kamba mkulu wa nhambiko kolondigwa yalawe mulukolo lwa Lawi kamba wahenga zake, ila katendigwa na mhiko za ugima zilibule nziga. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/>Kwavija Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “Gweye iyo mkulu wa nhambiko ulibule nziga, mumnhongo wa ukulu wa nhambiko wa Melikizedeki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">ZABULI 110:4</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Ndagizi ya umwaka ikigwa hamgwazo kwavija ikala ikonhoke na hailondigwa na wanhu. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Kwavija Malagizo ga Musa hagatendile kinhu chochose kiwebule king'hwaso. Na sambi tamanilo dinogile ng'hani kubanza dija da umwaka divika, na kubitila hijo tokwenhuka behi na Mulungu.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Mbuli ino itendigwa na kiduilo cha Mulungu, ila wayagwe watendigwa kuwa wakulu wa nhambiko bila kiduilo chochose. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/>Ila Yesu katendigwa kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko na kiduilo, haja Mulungu viyamulongele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">“Mndewa keka kilagano mkuiduila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">na hagalula ngelegeza zake.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Gweye iyo mkulu wa nhambiko ulibule nziga.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">ZABULI 110:4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Sama ya kiduilo kino, Yesu kagaluka kingilambago cha lagano dinogile ng'hani kubanza dija da ichanduso.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>Uhaleka gano, wakulu wa nhambiko wa umwaka wakala bwando, kwavija wakala wodanganhika, avo imwe yahadanganhika kosaguligwa iyagwe giladi yasole hanhu ha ija yadanganhike. <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Ila kwavija Yesu kokala gunge na gunge, sang'hano yake ya ukulu wa nhambiko yokala milongo yose. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Avo heyo kodaha kuwakombola kabisa awo womcholela Mulungu kubitila heyo, kwavija mazua gose heyo kokala yowatambikila hewo.<verse eid="HEB 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Kwavija ilumba tweye tuwe na Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kamba ino, munhu yang'alile, yalibule mbuli ihile, yalekile kunyolodoswa na kinhu chochose, yali kutali na vilozo, na yenuligwe uchana kubanza ulanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/>Halingile na wakulu wa wakulu wa nhambiko wayagwe. Heyo halondigwa tanhu kulava nhosa mazua gose sama ya vilozo vake mwenyego na abaho sama ya vilozo va wanhu. Kalava nhosa imwe, mwanza umwe mkipigiti chake chose ahaja viyailavile mwenyego. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Kwavija Malagizo ga Musa gowasagula wanhu wazabuzigwe wawe wakulu wa wakulu wose wa nhambiko, ila kiduilo kizile hachugu cha Malagizo kimsagula Mwana, ayo yalekile kuhungula hanhu milongo yose.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Iyo Mkulu Wetu wa Wakulu Wose wa Nhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>Kinhu kikulu mmbuli zino zitulonga icho kino, tuna Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko ayo yakalile mumkono wa ukulume wa ikigoda cha undewa cha Mulungu yali na yenzi kili kuulanga, <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>ayo yosang'hanika Hanhu Hang'alile, mdihema da ikweli da kuiting'hanila diwambigwe na Mndewa, na sio diwambigwe na munhu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Wakulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko wasaguligwa walave nhosa ya vinhu na nhosa ya kuchinja wang'onyo, avo na Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko itulinayo vivija kalondigwa yawe na kinhu cha kulava. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Kamba yahawile muisi, sambiyawe mkulu wa nhambiko, kwavija kuna wakulu wa nhambiko wolava nhosa mkugawinza Malagizo ga Musa vugalonga. <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Wosang'hanika hana Ihanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani, aho kuli na mwigo na sisila da kija kili kuulanga. Kino kicho kilamso cha Musa kuzumigwa viyakalile behi na kudizenga dihema da kuiting'hanila, yolongeligwa, “Lola utende kila kinhu kamba vija vuulagusiligwe kuja kudigongo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:40">KUHALAWA 25:40</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Ila sambi Yesu kagweleligwa sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko izamile ng'hani kubanza yao hewo, kamba vudili lagano diyekile hagatigati ya Mulungu na wanhu zake vudizamile ng'hani kubanza Lagano da Umwaka, kwavija dilola ng'hani vilagano vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Kamba lagano dija da ichanduso dihawile bule ving'hwaso, sambidilondigwe lagano da ikabili. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Ila Mulungu kona gehile mwa wanhu zake avo kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">“Mazua gokwiza, kolonga Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">vondaniditende lagano da isambi na wanhu wa Islaeli hamoja na wanhu wa Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Si kamba lagano dija dinitendile na wahenga zao</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">kipigiti vuniwagogile mkono kuwalava kulawa muisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">Kwavija hawadigogile lagano jangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:9">avo niwaleka, kolonga Mndewa.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>Na dino dijo lagano dondanitende na wanhu wa Islaeli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">mkipigiti chondakize, kolonga Mndewa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Nogeka malagizo gangu mngelegeza zao</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">na kugandika mmioyo yao.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">Nowa Mulungu wao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">na hewo wowa wanhu zangu.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>Haduhu yondayamfundize miyage</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">ama kuilongela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Mtange Mndewa.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">Kwavija wose wokwiza kunitanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">songela mdodo mbaka mkulu.<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Nokugela kumgongo kuhonyela kuwahonyele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">na siza kukumbukila vilozo vao.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">YELEMIA 31:31-34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Mkudikema lagano dino “Lagano da Isambi,” nhegulo yake iyo ino, kadilonga dija da ichanduso kamba kipigiti chake kibita avo hadilondigwa na wanhu. Na kamba kipigiti chake kibita basi mkipigiti kidodo hamwande dopotela.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Muisi na Nhambiko ya Kuulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Lagano da ichanduso dikala na ndagizi mnhambiko na vivija dikala na hanhu ha kutambikila hano muisi. <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Hema da kuiting'hanila dikala na magati mabili. Mdigati da ichanduso kukala na kinala cha kwikila kiwenge, meza, na mikate ing'alile ikigwe muimeza. Gati dino dikemigwa Hanhu Hang'alile. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Kuchugu cha guo ditungikigwe kukala na gati da ikabili dikemigwe Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani, <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>dikalile na kilingo cha kulavila nhosa cha zahabu cha kufushila ubane na sanduku da lagano digubikigwe na zahabu. Sanduku dino da lagano dikala na kombe da zahabu dimemile mana mgati yake, fimbo ya Haloni ikalile na nzukila, na zija zimbamha mbili za mabwe zandikigwe ndagizi longo dimwe za lagano. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Uchana ya sanduku dino da lagano kukala na makelubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Makelubi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iyo vinhu vilumbigwe na Mulungu vili kuulanga vili na mabawa.</char></note> wali na yenzi wogubika hanhu ha kusegezelwa vilozo na sisila jao. Ila hatudaha kusimulila ng'hani mbuli zino.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>Vinhu vose vuvikalile vikigwe kamba vino, mazua gose wakulu wa nhambiko wengila mgati da ichanduso kusang'hana sang'hano zao za nhambiko. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Ila Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko iiyeka yokwingila mgati da ikabili, na heyo kokwingila mwanza umwe muna umulao umwe, na kokwingila na mulopa awo wondayaulave sama yake mwenyego na sama ya vilozo va wanhu viwatendile bila kuvitanga. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Mmbuli ino Loho wa Mulungu kotugubulila kamba nzila ya kwingilila Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani haivuguke kipigiti hema da kuiting'hanila da ichanduso vudikalile dimile. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Ino iyo ningo ya kipigiti kino kitulinacho. Yolagusa kamba nhunza zikalile zilavigwa na wang'onyo wakalile wachinjigwa havidahile kung'aliza udaho wa wanhu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>ila ikala mbuli ilolile ng'hani kuja na kung'wa na sona bwando za kuing'aliza, mbuli za lukuli zitendeke mbaka kipigiti cha Mulungu kuvitenda vinhu vose viwe va sambi kivikile.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Ila Kilisto keza kamba Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko wa vinhu vinogile vija vili hano. Hema da kuiting'hanila doyosang'hanika mgati yake kulu kubanza dija da ichanduso na dina vinhu vose, hema dija haditendigwe na munhu, na hadili muulumwengu uno. <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>Kengila Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani mwanza umwe, na hengile na mulopa wa menhe ama ng'ombe, ila kengila na mulopa wake mwenyego, avo kaugula ukombola wa digunge sama yetu. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Mulopa wa menhe na ng'ombe na tozi da bogwa da mwanang'ombe wonyunyiziligwa mwa awo wanyolodoke na kuwang'aliza, avo woneke wang'ala mng'huli zao. <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Kilisto, ayo kubitila Loho wa digunge kailava heyo mwenyego ha Mulungu bila kuwa na kinhu kihile. Mianza mingahi mulopa wake woung'aliza udaho wetu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile kulawa mmbuli zitugalila ifa, giladi tumtambikile Mulungu mwene ugima?<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Sama ya mbuli ino Kilisto iyo mgombeleza wa lagano da isambi, giladi awo wakemigwe na Mulungu wabokele kilagano cha uhazi wa digunge, kwavija Kilisto kadanganhika giladi kuwakombola kulawa m'vilozo vitendeke mdilagano da ichanduso.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Mmbuli ya lupwilili lwa ugozi wa vinhu va munhu, yolondigwa itangike kamba munhu yandike lupwilili luja kesha kudanganhika, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>kwavija lupwilili lwa ugozi wa vinhu lwabule mhiko kipigiti munhu yalwandike yang'hali mgima, ila lokwiza kupata mhiko haja vondayadanganhike. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Kino kicho kilamso hata lagano da ichanduso hadisongile bila mulopa. <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Kwavija Musa viyaipetile kila ndagizi mwa wanhu wose kulingana na vugalagize Malagizo ga Musa, kasola mulopa wa ng'ombe na wa menhe hamoja na mazi na kukinyunyizila ikitabu na kuwanyunyizila wanhu wose, mkuvubika mijusu midung'hu ya ng'hondolo na matambi ga hisopo. <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>Kalonga, “Uno uwo mulopa wa lagano ajo Mulungu diyawalagize mweye mdigoge.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">KUHALAWA 24:8</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/>Vivija Musa kavinyunyizila mulopa via vose visang'hanike mnhambiko na dihema. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/>Kweli kabisa kulingana na Malagizo ga Musa, vinhu behi na vose ving'alizwa na mulopa, na bila mulopa haduhu kugeligwa kumgongo kwa vilozo.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhosa ya Kilisto Yosegeza Vilozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Vinhu vino vikwiga vinhu va kuulanga volondigwa ving'alizwe na nhosa kamba ino. Ila vinhu va kuulanga venyego volonda nhosa inogile ng'hani. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Kwavija Kilisto hengile Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani hatendigwe na makono ga wanhu, aho halingile kamba hanhu hang'alile ng'hani ha kuulanga, ila kengila kuulanga kwenyego, ako sambi kema haulongozi wa Mulungu sama yetu. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko wa Wayahudi kokwingila Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani kila mulao na mulopa wa wang'onyo, ila Kilisto hengile kuulanga kuilava nhosa heyo mwenyego mianza bwando, <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>ihawile hivo Kilisto yahalondigwe kugaya mianza bwando songela kulumbigwa kwa ulumwengu. Ila sambi kalawilila mwanza umwe mkipigiti cha kimambukizo giladi yavisegeze vilozo kubitila kuilava nhosa heyo mwenyego. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Kamba vija munhu viyolondigwa kudanganhika mwanza umwe, imala abaho nhaguso, <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/>avo Kilisto kalavigwa nhosa mwanza umwe giladi yavisegeze vilozo va wanhu bwando. Kokwiza mwanza wa ikabili, si sama ya kuvisegeza vilozo va wanhu ila kuugala ukombola ha awo womulolela.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Kwavija Malagizo ga Musa gakala sisila da vinhu vinogile vikwiza na sio vinhu venyego. Sama ya kilamso kino havidahika kuwatenda wawe bule vilozo awo womkwenhukila Mulungu na nhosa zizija ziibwelela bila kuziga mulao kwa mulao havidahika kusuluzwa! <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Kamba wanhu wakalile womtambikila Mulungu wakala wang'alizwe kweli kulawa m'vilozo vao, sambiwaiyone wana vilozo, na nhosa zose zihazigile. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Ila nhosa zino zowakumbusa vilozo vao mulao kwa mulao. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Kwavija mulopa wa songolomi wa ng'ombe na menhe haudaha kusegeza vilozo.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>Avo Kilisto viyezile muulumwengu uno, kamulongela Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">“Nhosa za kuchinja wang'onyo na nhosa za vinhu huzilondile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">ila lukuli luunigwelele lulo luulonda nikulavile.<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Hunogeligwe na nhosa za kulukuza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:6">na hunogeligwe na nhosa za kusegeza vilozo.<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Abaho nilonga, ‘Nabaha, Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kugatenda gaja gakunogele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">kamba vinyandikiligwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">ZABULI 40:6-8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Tanhu kalonga, “Nhosa za kuchinja wang'onyo na nhosa za vinhu, nhosa za kulukuza na nhosa za kusegeza vilozo huzilonda tena hunogelwe nazo,” hata kamba ving'hali vilavigwa kulingana na Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Abaho, kongeza, “Nabaha, niza kusang'hana gaja goulonda.” Avo Mulungu kosegeza Lagano da Umwaka na hanhu hake kokwika lagano da sambi. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Kwavija Yesu Kilisto kasang'hana gaja gayamulondile Mulungu kutenda, tweye tose tung'alizwa kulawa m'vilozo kubitila nhosa ya lukuli lwake ilavigwe mwanza umwe sama ya wanhu wose.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Kila mkulu wa nhambiko kotenda sang'hano yake kila zua, na kulava nhosa iilingile mianza bwando, ila nhosa zino hazidaha kusegeza vilozo. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Ila Kilisto viyailavile mwanza umwe nhosa imwe ikala ilumbile milao yose sama ya vilozo, kakala hasi kumkono wa ukulume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Songela kipigiti kija kobeta Mulungu yaweke wadumuka zake hasi ya magulu gake. <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Kwavija sama ya nhosa imwe kawasuluza awo wasuluzwe vilozo vao.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>Vivija na Loho wa Mulungu kolava usindila wake mmbuli ino. Tanhu kolonga,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>“Dino dijo lagano dondanitende na hewo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">kipigiti chondakize.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Nokwika malagizo gangu mmioyo yao,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">na kugandika mnzonzi zao,” Mndewa kalonga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:33">YELEMIA 31:33</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Abaho, kongeza, “Sikumbukila vilozo vao na mbuli zao zihile.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:34">YELEMIA 31:34</ref></char>. </note> <verse eid="HEB 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Avo vilozo na mbuli zao zihile vihageligwa kumgongo, nhosa ya kusegeza vilozo hailondigwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Natumkwenhukile Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, tuna ugangamalo mkulu wa kwingila Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani sama ya ifa ya Yesu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Kubitila ifa yake, Yesu kavugula nzila ya sambi ilava ugima kubitila guo ditungikigwe Mng'anda ya Mulungu, ichola Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Na avija vituli na mkulu wa nhambiko mkulu yotawala ng'anda ya Mulungu, <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/>avo natumkwenhukile Mulungu na mioyo ilibule uzenzeleganye na nhamanila ituitangile goya, na mioyo yetu ing'alizwe kulawa muudaho wetu wihile wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, na tuzisuluze ng'huli zetu na mazi gang'alile. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Natudigoge ng'hani tamanilo dituditogole bila kudungwadungwa, kwavija Mulungu itwikile nayo kilagano kabule uzenzeleganye. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Na tugelegeze vija vitudaha kuiswagiza twetwe kwa twetwe kuwa na noge na kutenda ganogile. <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>Sambimuleke kuiting'hana, kamba viwotenda wanhu wayagwe, ila natuigangamize, kamba vumkona zua da nhaguso da mmabehi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Tuhagendelela kutenda vilozo giladi kuno twishile kuibokela ilimu ya kweli, haduhu nhosa iyagwe yoyose yondaisegeze vilozo, <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/>ila kinhu kisigale kicho kino, kubeta na kingudemo nhaguso yondaize na moto ukalika awo wondauwalambite wadumuka wa Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/>Munhu yoyose yagadulukile Malagizo ga Musa hameso ga wasindila wabili ama wadatu kakomigwa bila koneligwa bazi. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/>Mokwagiza nhaguso ng'hali kiasi gani yoolondigwa yaipate munhu yam'bojage Mwana wa Mulungu na magulu gake, ayo yaautendile mulopa wa lagano uja umng'aliza heyo uwe kamba kinhu haking'alile, na ayo yamuligile Loho wa Mulungu ayo yotonela bazi tweye? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/>Kwavija tumtanga ija yalongile, “Sang'hano ya kubwelezela si yenu mweye, ila yangu nie, noliha,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 32:35</ref></char>.</note> na vivija ilongigwa, “Mndewa kowatagusa wanhu zake.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:36">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 32:36</ref></char>; <char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 135:14">ZABULI 135:14</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Munhu kamba ino yahalagalila mmakono ga Mulungu yali na ugima, kodumba ng'hani!<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Gelegezeni gaja gawalawilile mweye umwaka kipigiti vum'bokele Usenga wa Mulungu, mgazigwa na vinhu bwando, ila mweye mgangamala. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>Kipigiti kiyagwe mkala muligigwa hameso ga wanhu na kugazigwa, na kipigiti kiyagwe hamudumbile kukala hamoja na awo wawatendele mbuli hizo. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>Muwonela bazi waja wakalile mkifungo, na vum'bokonywe vinhu venu, mwazaganya mkudeng'ha, kwavija m'vitanga kamba mng'hali na vinhu bwando va muloho vinogile ng'hani vondavikale milongo yose. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Avo sambimuuleke mgangamalo wenu kwavija wowagalila nhunza ng'hulu. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Kwavija molondigwa mwazaganye, giladi mgatende gaja gamnogele Mulungu na kubokela gaja Mulungu gayailagane namwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:37">“King'hali kipigiti kidodo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">na ayo yokwiza kokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">na hakawilila.<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>Ila wanhu zangu walibule uzenzeleganye wokala mnhamanila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">na munhu yoyose yobwela kukisogo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">moyo wangu haunogelwa nayo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">HABAKUKI 2:3-4</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Tweye hatuli mmwanza wa awo wobwela kukisogo ama awo wapotele, ila twa mmwanza wa awo wali na nhamanila na wakomboligwe.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Kumtamanila Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Avo nhamanila nhegulo yake iyo kweli ya kija kitutamanila na lugubulo lwa gaja gatuleka kugona. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Sama ya nhamanila wahenga zetu watogoligwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>Tweye tuvitanga kamba ulumwengu ulumbigwa na nhamanila kubitila mbuli ya Mulungu, avo gaja gotukona gatendigwa kulawa m'vinhu vileka koneka.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>Sama ya nhamanila Abeli kamulavila Mulungu nhosa inogile kum'banza Kaini. Kubitila mbuli ino katogoligwa kuwa munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye, na Mulungu mwenyego kazitogola nhosa zake. Kadanganhika, ila kubitila nhamanila yake, tokiifunza mbaka lelo.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Henoko sambiyadanganhike, ila kasoligwa na kugaligwa uchana ha Mulungu. Haduhu munhu yamonile kwavija Mulungu kamsola. Henoko kipigiti hanasoligwa, kapetigwa kamba munhu yamnogele Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Haduhu munhu yodaha kumnogela Mulungu bila nhamanila, kwavija kila munhu yokwiza ha Mulungu kolondigwa yatogole kamba Mulungu kabaho na kowamoteza awo womzahila.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Nuhu yaihulike nzuma ya mbuli zikwiza ziyalekile kuzona. Kamtogola Mulungu na kutenda safina iyo imkombole heyo na mulango wake, hakimambukizo ulumwengu utagusigwa, na Nuhu kapetigwa na Mulungu kuwa mwende sama ya nhamanila iyakalile nayo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Ablaham yatogole, ahaja viyalongeligwe na Mulungu yasegele yachole kuna iisi iyamduilile kamba komgwelela iwe uhazi wake. Kasegela kulawa muisi yake mwenyego bila kuvimanya kuja koyochola. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/>Sama ya nhamanila Ablaham kakala muihema muisi ya uhenza Mulungu iyekile nayo kilagano. Vivija milao ya hamwande Isaka na Yakobo, awo wakalile muihema kamba viyakalile Ablaham, wabokela uhazi kamba uno. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Kwavija Ablaham kakala yobeta Wambo dili na misingi ya digunge, dibunigwe na kuzengigwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Ablaham yawe tata, hata kamba kakala m'vyele ng'hani na Sala mwenyego ikala havidahika kupata mwana. Kamtogola Mulungu kamba kakivikiza kilagano chake. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/>Hata kamba Ablaham kakala m'vyele ng'hani, kulawa munhu ino imwe wavumbuka wanhu bwando kamba nhondo za kuulanga vuzilibule mheta, na kamba misenga ya mumgwazo wa ibahali viilibule mheta.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>Wanhu wose wano wadanganhika kuno wali na nhamanila bila kubokela kilagano chao, ila wachona kilagano chao kutalitali na kukideng'hela. Watogola kamba hewo wakala wahenza na wabita nzila hano muulumwengu. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Wanhu wolonga mbuli kamba zino wolagusa kamba wozahila isi yao wenyego. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Hewo hawakalile wogendelela kugelegeza isi iwailekile. Kamba wahatendile avo, wahabweleganye. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Ila wakala woibeta isi inogile ng'hani, isi ya kuulanga. Na Mulungu honile kinyala kukemigwa Mulungu wao, kwavija kawatendela wambo dinogile ng'hani kuulanga sama yao.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>Nhamanila imtenda Ablaham yamulave Isaka kipigiti Mulungu viyamgezile. Ablaham kakala imwe wa awo wabokele kilagano, hata avo katogola kumulava nhosa mwanage yali yeiyeka, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/>hata kamba Mulungu kamulongela, “Lukolo lunikile kilagano nagwe kolupata kubitila Isaka.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">MWANDUSO 21:12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Ablaham kakala yogelegeza kamba Mulungu kodaha kumzusa munhu kulawa mkudanganhika, na kamba vija viyalongile, kampata Isaka mwanage kulawa mkudanganhika.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Isaka yawamoteze Yakobo na Esau, yowapetela vija vondawawe mazua ga haulongozi.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Yakobo yawamoteze wana wose wa Usufu kipigiti viyalondile kudanganhika. Na kamtambikila Mulungu kuno yasagamile fimbo yake ya kutembelela.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Usufu yawalongele Waislaeli wokwiza kusegela kulawa Misili kipigiti viyakalile behi na kudanganhika na kuwalongela vija vowolondigwa wamzike.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>Nhamanila iyo iwatendile tata na mamaake Musa wamfise heyo milenge midatu songela viyavumbuke kwavija wamona mwana ija kakala yanogile ng'hani, na hawadumbile kugadulukila malagizo ga mndewa wa isi ya Misili.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Musa kipigiti viyakulile yaleme kukemigwa mwana wa biti Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Kasagula kugaya hamoja na wanhu wa Mulungu kubanza kunogelwa na umwilile wa vilozo mkipigiti kiguhi. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Kakala yogelegeza kamba vinoga kugeligwa kinyala sama ya Kilisto kubanza kupata ugoli wose wa Misili, kwavija meso gake galola kuulongozi kuna inhunza ya kumwande.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Musa yasegele Misili bila kudumba lusango lwa mndewa wa isi ya Misili. Heyo habwelile kuchugu kwavija kamona Mulungu ayo yoleka koneka na meso. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/>Nhamanila iyo imtendile Musa yaisongeze Pasaka na ndagizi ya kubaka mulopa mzinyivi giladi msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga yagweleligwe udaho wa kukoma sambiyawakome wana wa udele wa Waislaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>Nhamanila iyo iwatendile wanhu wakanhize Bahali Indung'hu kamba wobita muisi inyalile, ila Wamisili viwagezile kutenda avo, wadanganhikila mmazi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Nhamanila iyo itendile konhi da wambo da Yeliko digwe, kipigiti wanhu viwamambukize kudizunguluka mazua saba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/>Sama ya nhamanila Lahabu, ija imtwanzi yakalile yotenda ugoni ndwanga, hakomigwe na awo wamdulukile Mulungu kwavija kawabokela goya visepi.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>Avo nilonge choni? Kipigiti kimala cha kuwapetela mbuli za Gidioni, Balaka, Samsoni, Yefta, Daudi, Samweli, na wahokozi, <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/>awo kubitila nhamanila wazihuma ndewa, wasegeza uzenzeleganye, na wabokela gaja gawailagane na Mulungu. Wainuniza milomo ya simba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/>wauzima moto ukwaka, wahonyokwa na ng'hali za mizele, na udonhi wao ugaluka mhiko. Wawa wanhu wene mhiko kuna ing'hondo na kuwahuma asikali wa isi za kutali. <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/>Watwanzi wawabokela wanhu zao wadanganhike wazusigwe na kuwa wagima kabili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 11:35">Wanhu wayagwe wagazigwa, na walema kufunguligwa, giladi wapate mzuso unogile ng'hani. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/>Wayagwe watendeligwa uponela na kulanhigwa na hata kufungigwa na minyolo na kugeligwa mkifungo. <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/>Wakomigwa mkutoigwa na mabwe, wakanhigwa na misumeno, wakomigwa na mizele, watembela kuno wavalile mikwembe ya menhe na ng'hondolo, wakala wakumbulu, wagazigwa, na watendeligwa gehile. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Wanhu wano wakala wanogile ng'hani na ulumwengu haulumbile kukala na wanhu wano. Wazungulukazunguluka muluwala na mmigongo, muna zimhango na mmikolongo ya isi.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Wanhu wano wose wapata nhogolwa inogile sama ya nhamanila yao, hata avo haduhu hata munhu imwe mmwanza wao yapatile kija kiwailagane na Mulungu. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Kwavija Mulungu kakala yogesa kinhu kinogile ng'hani sama yetu tweye, avo woleka kuhungula hanhu kipigiti vondatuleke kuhungula hanhu.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Mulungu Tataetu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Kwavija vutuzungulukwe na dale kulu da wasindila kamba dino, avo natwike hamgwazo kila kinhu kituzuila na kila kilozo kitunamata himahima, na tukimbile na mwazaganyo mkimbilo Mulungu uyawikile haulongozi wetu. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Meso getu gamulole Yesu, heyo yawile waichanduso na waikimambukizo mnhamanila yetu. Sama ya deng'ho diyekiligwe kuja kuyakalile yochola, kawazaganya msalaba bila kugelegeza kinyala chake. Sambi kakala hasi kumkono wa ukulume wa kigoda cha undewa cha Mulungu.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Mgelegezeni ayo yazaganye ubezi kamba uno kulawa mwa wanhu wene vilozo, giladi sambimdonhe na kubogoyoka umoyo. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>Kuiyoha kumuiyoha sama ya kuvilema vilozo hamunaiyoha kuvikila kudanganhika. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Na muisemwa mbuli za kuwagangamiza Mulungu ziyawalongele mweye kamba wanage?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwanangu, sambiuzabuze mulanho wa Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">na sambiubogoyoke umoyo haja vondayakukomhokele.<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>Kwavija Mndewa komzuma munhu yoyose yamnogele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">na komulanha munhu yoyose iyomtogola kuwa mwanage.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">LONZI 3:11-12</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Yazaganyeni gaja gomgaya kamba tata viyomtoa mwanage. Migayo yenu yolagusa kamba Mulungu kowatendela vija vilondigwa kuwatendela wanage. Vino hana mwana yalekile kulanhigwa na tataake? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Kamba hulanhigwe kamba viwali wana zake wose, basi nhegulo yake gweye huli mwanage wa ikweli, ila kwa mwana wa halamu. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Tata zetu wa kiunhu wotulanha na towahishimila, avo tolondigwa tumuhishimile ng'hani Tata wetu wa muloho giladi tuwe na ugima! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Tata zetu wa kiunhu watulanha mkipigiti kiguhi, kamba viwonile vinoga kumwao, ila Mulungu kotulanha sama ya kutulondela tweye ganogile, giladi tuupate ung'azi wake. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Tuhalanhigwa, tokona usungu mkipigiti kija na sio umwilile. Ila kwa vovose vija, kumwande awo walanhigwe wohuna nhunza ya kukala ukazi wa kuwa bule uzenzeleganye uli na tindiwalo.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi na Nzuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>Avo, inuleni makono genu gadonhile, na gageleni mhiko mavindi genu gogudema! <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/>Gendeleleni kutembela mnzila igoloke giladi yali na mgulu ulemale sambiyasiguke ila yahonyigwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">LONZI 4:26</ref></char>. </note><verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>Kaleni na wanhu wose mditindiwalo, na mkale ukazi ung'alile, kwavija haduhu munhu yondayamone Mndewa kamba hakalile vino. <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/>Teganyeni sambim'bweleganye kuchugu kulawa mngekewa ya Mulungu. Munhu sambiyagaluke m'biki wa usungu, ukula na kusongeza migayo bwando ilawa muna isumu uulinayo. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/>Sambikuwe na munhu mgoni ama yaleka kumnogela Mulungu kamba Esau, ayo sama ya mandia ga laka imwe, kaguza hanhu ha uhazi wa kuvumbuka wa ichanduso. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/>Kamba vum'vitangile, hakimambukizo viyalondile kuhala motelo zino, kalemigwa, kwavija hapatile nafasi ya kuvileka vilozo vake, hata kamba kaizahila na mahozi.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Mweye ham'bitile kuna Idigongo da Sinai didaha kukwasika, dikwaka moto, na ham'bitile mdiziza, ham'bitile mdigiogio na mdikukuzumbi, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/>ham'bitile kuna imhalati ilila, na ham'bitile kuna idizwi ajo wanhu wahadihulika hawalonda kudihulika kabili kamba wanhu wa Islaeli viwabitile. <verse eid="HEB 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>Kwavija hawadahile kwazaganya ndagizi iwagweleligwe, ilonga, “Hata kamba mng'onyo yahakikwasa ikigongo, kolondigwa yatoigwe na mibwe mbaka yadanganhike.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">KUHALAWA 19:12-13</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/>Mbuli zija zoneka zikala zidumbiza ng'hani avo Musa kalonga, “Nie nogudema na nokona bwembwe!”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 9:19</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Ila mweye m'bita kuna Idigongo da Sayuni, m'bita Yelusalemu ya kuulanga, wambo da Mulungu mwene ugima, na m'bita mmaalufu kwa maalufu ga wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga mumting'hano umemile ndeng'helelo. <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/>M'bita mdale da wana wa udele wa Mulungu, awo matwaga gao gandikigwe kuulanga, na m'bita ha Mulungu, ayo yowatagusa wanhu wose, na m'bita muloho wa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye yali kuulanga ayo sambi yatendigwe yaleke kuhungula hanhu. <verse eid="HEB 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>M'bita ha Yesu, ayo yali mgombelezi wa lagano da isambi, na m'bita mmulopa umizigwe, uja ulonga mbuli zinogile kubanza mbuli za mulopa wa Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>Avo, teganyeni, sambimuleme kumtegeleza ayo yolonga namwe. Awo walemile kumtegeleza ayo yawalongele usenga wa Mulungu muulumwengu hawahonyokwe, avo kamba na tweye tuhamuhindukila kisogo ayo yolonga kulawa kuulanga hatuhonyokwa. <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/>Kipigiti kija dizwi jake ditigisa isi, ila sambi keka kilagano yolonga, “Noitigisa isi mwanza wa ikabili na sio isi iiyeka ila vivija na ulanga.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">HAGAI 2:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Ulonzi uno ulonga, “mwanza wa ikabili,” wolagusa kamba vinhu vilumbigwe votigiswa na kusegezwa, avo vinhu vondavileke kutigisigwa vosigala.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Avo natulave hewela, kwavija tobokela undewa uja haudaha kutigisika. Natumuheweze Mulungu na kumtambikila mnzila yondaimnogele na hishima na kidumbo. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/>Kwavija Mulungu wetu iyo moto usakaza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 4:24</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Kumnogeza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Gendeleleni kuinogela wenyego kwa wenyego kamba ndugu. <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/>Sambimwisemwe kuwabokela wahenza mzikae zenu, kuna wanhu watendile vino na wawabokela wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga bila kuvimanya. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Sambimuwasemwe awo wali mkifungo kamba vija mwa mkifungo hamoja na hewo, na awo wogazigwa kamba vija mogazigwa hamoja na hewo.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>Kuisola na kuhishimilwe na wanhu wose, na watwanzi sambiwawe vizenzeleganye ha wambigalo zao, na wambigalo vivija, kwavija Mulungu kowatagusa wagoni na wanhu wose washalati.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>Sambimnogelwe na hela, na mwenelwe na kija kimulinacho, kwavija Mulungu kalonga, “Siwaleka mweye mwiyeka, na siwasa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 31:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/>Avo tolonga bila kudumba kamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">“Mndewa iyo yonitaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 13:6">sidumba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 13:6">Munhu konhenda choni?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:6-7">ZABULI 118:6-7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Wagelegezeni wakulu zenu waja wawapeteleni usenga wa Mulungu. Gagelegezeni ganogile gose gawatendile muugima wao, na mwige nhamanila yao. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Yesu Kilisto iyo iija mayo, lelo, na mazua gose. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Sambimuhembeluswe na mafundo gogose gamulekile kugatanga, kwavija vinoga moyo ugeligwe mhiko na ngekewa ya Mulungu na sio na ndagizi za vakuja azo zilekile kuwataza awo wozigoga.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Tweye tuna kilingo cha kulavila nhosa acho wakulu wa nhambiko wosang'hanika mdihema da kuiting'hanila hawatogozwa kuja nhosa yoyose ilavigwa mkilingo hicho. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/>Mkulu wa Wakulu wose wa Nhambiko kougala mulopa wa wang'onyo Hanhu Hang'alile Ng'hani giladi yaulave uwe nhosa ya kusegeza vilozo, ila zing'huli za iwang'onyo zolukuzwa hanze ya ing'hambi. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Sama ya kilamso kino Yesu vivija kadanganhika hamgwazo wa idiwambo giladi yawang'alize wanhu kulawa m'vilozo vao na mulopa wake. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Avo natuchole kuyali heyo kunze ya ing'hambi, na tusangile kinyala chake. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Kwavija hano muisi twabule wambo dikala gunge na gunge sama yetu, avo tozahila wambo dondadize. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Avo natugendelele kumulavila Mulungu nhosa za nhogolwa mazua gose kubitila Yesu, malawililo ga milomo itogole twaga jake. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Sambimwisemwe kutenda ganogile na kuisangila vinhu na waenu, kwavija Mulungu konogelwa na nhosa kamba zino.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Wategelezeni waja wowalongoza na mtende gaja gowolonga, kwavija wogonelela sama yenu kamba wanhu wondawalave mheta za sang'hano zao ha Mulungu. Wategelezeni giladi sang'hano yao iwe ndeng'ha, na sambiiwe nhwanganiko kumwao, kwavija kamba wahatwanganika, havinoga kumwenu.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Tutambikileni kwavija tuvitanga kamba tuna udaho ung'alile wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, na tosulukila kutenda mbuli zinogile mazua gose. <verse eid="HEB 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Nowayalalila ng'hani mnhambikile giladi Mulungu yanibweze hima kumwenu.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nhambiko ya Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Mulungu yali na tindiwalo, ayo yamzusile Mndewa wetu Yesu, ayo yali mchunga mkulu wa ng'hondolo kubitila mulopa wake wa lagano da digunge, <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>yawagwelele mweye vinhu vose va kutenda gaja gamnogele, na kubitila Yesu Kilisto yatutendele moyo wa kutenda gaja gomnogela heyo, yenzi iwe kumwake milongo yose. Amina.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, nowayalalila mtegeleze goya usenga uno wa kuwagangamiza, kwavija lupwilili luno luniwandikile hauli mtali. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>Nolonda mweye m'vitange kamba ndugu yetu Timoteo kalawa mkifungo. Kamba yahalopola kuvika, vondanize kumwenu, nokwiza na heyo.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Walamseni awo wowalongoza hamoja na wanhu wose wa Mulungu. Ndugu zetu kulawa Italia wowalamsa.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>Ngekewa ya Mulungu iwe hamoja na mweye mose.<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
